      "y": -330,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "Pelvy, direction B. The app screens are redrawn from the next version (the Pelvy Lite demo of March 2026): sage means let go, slate means work, a ring means hold.\nThe logo is the 2024 logo copied into vector and made flat. It is a candidate until it is approved."
    },
